!!! 17-types-and-text.matrix
!!!
!!! The two-tier type scheme, and text without any escape syntax.
!!! Full rationale in ../docs/types-and-text.md.
!!!
!!! Tier one is what a program says unless it has a reason not to:
!!!     text  number  floating  boolean  nothing
!!! Encoding, width and precision are not among its concerns.
!!!
!!! Tier two is the machine representation, reached only through "override":
!!!     override integer   i32
!!!     override long      i64
!!!     override byte      u8   (wrapping)
!!!     override double    f64
!!!
!!! A machine type is NOT legal in a bare type position. "as byte" is an
!!! error; "as override byte" is the spelling. That is the point of the
!!! keyword -- the default path is ergonomic, and every drop to an exact
!!! width is marked and greppable.
!!!
!!! "short", "unsigned", "decimal", "single" and "letter" are reserved and
!!! REJECTED with a specific message, because NIL cannot carry them: its only
!!! unsigned type is byte, it has no fixed-point type, and it has no char.
!!! Encoding and one-letter text belong to the standard library, not here.

book demo.text

!!! Ergonomic types are what a program says unless it has a reason not to.
answer   returns number   begin paragraph give 42 end paragraph
ratio    returns floating begin paragraph give 0.5 end paragraph
ready    returns boolean  begin paragraph give true end paragraph
greeting returns text     begin paragraph give "hello" end paragraph

!!! "override" marks every drop to a machine representation, so reaching for
!!! one is deliberate and greppable.
pack receives version as override byte, length as override long returns override long begin paragraph
    give ((version becomes override long) shifted left by 16) bitwise or length
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph

    !!! A quoted literal is raw. No doubling, no backslashes.
    value path as text is "C:\dir\file.txt"
    value regex as text is "^[a-z]+\d*$"
    say path; say regex

    !!! A literal quote is the 'quote' constant, concatenated with 'plus' --
    !!! which is already text concatenation. There is no escape syntax.
    value said as text is "he said " plus quote plus "hi" plus quote
    say said

    !!! 'newline' and 'tab' likewise.
    say "one" plus newline plus "two"
    say "name" plus tab plus "value"

    !!! A raw block for anything awkward. Nothing inside is escaped, because
    !!! the terminator is a line-anchored keyword rather than a character.
    value banner as text is begin text
        He said "hi" and the path was C:\Users\me\file.txt
          this line keeps its extra indent
        {"json": "works too", "escaped": "nothing \n needed"}
    end text
    say banner

    give 0
end paragraph
